    "text": "DOMINICA PRIMA IN QUINQVAGESIMA.\nGehera\u00f0 nu, men \u00fea leofestan, hu Lucas se godspellere s\u00e6gde be \u00feisse ondweardan tide, ge eac be \u00fe\u00e6re\n\u00dea mid \u00fey \u00fee hit neal\u00e6hte \u00fe\u00e6re tide, H\u00e6lend genam his twelf \u00feegnas sundor of \u00fe\u00e6m weorode, & him to\n& he bi\u00f0 geseald h\u00e6\u00fenum mannum, \u00fe\u00e6t hie hine bysmrian.\nHie hine binda\u00f0 & swinga\u00fe & sp\u00e6tlia\u00f0 on his onsyne; & \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re swinglan hie hine ofslea\u00f0; & \u00fey\nHi \u00fea \u00fea Cristes \u00feegnas \u00feeossa worda nan ongeotan ne mehton; ac hie w\u00e6ron him bediglede, for\u00feon \u00fee\n\u00dea w\u00e6s geworden \u00fe\u00e6t H\u00e6lend geneal\u00e6hte Gericho.\n\u00dea s\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r sum blind \u00feearfa be \u00f0on wege, & gehyrde myccle menigo him beforan feran; \u00fea ahsode he\nHie him ondsworedon & cw\u00e6don, Hit is H\u00e6lend se Nazarenisca.\nHe \u00fea cleopode hluddre stefne, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Miltsa me, Dauides sunu, miltsa me.\n\u00dea foreferendan him budon \u00fe\u00e6t he swigade; & swa hie him swy\u00feor styrdon, swa he hludor cleopode, &\nH\u00e6lend \u00fea gestod, & hine het to him gel\u00e6don; & mid \u00fey \u00fee he him geneal\u00e6hte, he him tocw\u00e6\u00fe, Hw\u00e6t\nSe blinda him ondswerede & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Drihten, \u00fe\u00e6t ic m\u00e6ge geseon.\nH\u00e6lend him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Loca nu; \u00fein agen geleafa \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00fe geh\u00e6ledne.\nHe \u00fea sona inst\u00e6pes geseh, & \u00fea sona w\u00e6s Drihtne fylgende; & hine herede & weor\u00feode.\n& eal \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fee \u00feis wundor geseah, his noman myccledon.\nHw\u00e6t we nu gehyrdon \u00feis halige godspel beforan us r\u00e6dan, & \u00feeh we hit sceolan eft ofercwe\u00fean, \u00fe\u00e6t\nNu \u00e6r we gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6t H\u00e6lend his \u00feegnum s\u00e6de his \u00ferowunga & \u00fea sar & \u00f0a bysmra \u00fee he mid\nFor\u00f0on he \u00feis dyde \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00feonne hie gesawon his \u00f0a heardan bendas, \u00fe\u00e6t hie ne w\u00e6ron on heora\n&, \u00f0onne me hine gesawon sweltendne, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00feonne w\u00e6ron afrefrede, he him gehet his \u00e6riste, swa he\nHis \u00feegnas w\u00e6ron \u00feagyt fl\u00e6sclices modes, & n\u00e6ron mid gastes m\u00e6gene getremede.\nFor\u00feon hie ne mihton \u00fea word ongeotan \u00fe\u00e6s heofonlican gerynes, hw\u00e6\u00fere he getrymede heora geleafan\nNu we sceolan, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00f0a wundor gecyrran on so\u00fef\u00e6stnesse geleafan ures Drihtnes\nWe nestan \u00e6r hw\u00e6t se blinda w\u00e6s; nu we magon \u00feonne ongytan hw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t geryne tacna\u00fe.\nEal \u00feis mennisce cyn w\u00e6s on blindnesse, seo\u00f0\u00f0an \u00fea \u00e6restan men asceofene w\u00e6ron of gefean\nDrihten \u00fea \u00feurh his tocyme \u00feysne middangeard onlyhte, & eallum geleaffulum monnum heora gong\nHalige gewreotu us tacnia\u00fe \u00feas world \u00feurh \u00feone monan; for\u00feon \u00feonne he wexe\u00fe, he bi\u00f0 gelic \u00fe\u00e6m\nCw\u00e6\u00fe se godspellere, mid \u00fey \u00fee se H\u00e6lend geneal\u00e6hte Gericho, \u00fe\u00e6t leoht cyrde to \u00feon blindan.\n\u00de\u00e6t tacna\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t seo godcundnes onfeng ure tydran gecynde.\n\u00dea cyrde sona \u00fe\u00e6t heofonlice leoht to \u00feyssum menniscan cynne, \u00fee se \u00e6resta man forlet; & for\u00f0on God\nRihtlic \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t se blinda be \u00f0\u00e6m wege s\u00e6te w\u00e6dliende; for\u00feon \u00fee Drihten sylfa cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ic eom\n& se leofa\u00f0 & gelyfe\u00fe se \u00fee site\u00fe be \u00fe\u00e6m wege w\u00e6dliende, & \u00feonne bide\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s ecan leohtes, & no ne\nSe \u00feonne ne ongyte\u00fe \u00fea \u00feeostra his agenra synna, wite he \u00fe\u00e6t he bi\u00f0 wana \u00fe\u00e6s ecan leohtes, buton he\nCleopian we nu in eglum mode & inneweardre heortan, swa se blinda dyde, & cwe\u00fean, Miltsa me,\nSmeagean we nu & \u00feencan hw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t tacnode, \u00fe\u00e6t seo menigo styrde \u00fe\u00e6m blindan \u00fe\u00e6t he cleopode.\nIc \u00fee secge hw\u00e6t seo menego tacnode, \u00fea fl\u00e6sclican willan & \u00fea ungereclican uncysta.\n\u00dea cuma\u00fe oft \u00feurh deofles sceonessa \u00e6r to manna heortan, \u00e6r Drihtnes weorc \u00fe\u00e6r wunian mote; & hie\nGehyran we nu forhwon se blinda leoht onfeng, & hw\u00e6t he dyde \u00fea hine seo menego \u00fereade \u00fe\u00e6t he\nHe ma cegde & geornor b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t H\u00e6lend him miltsade: \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolan beon gel\u00e6rede\nCw\u00e6\u00fe se godspellere, H\u00e6lend ferde \u00fe\u00e6r for\u00fe, & \u00fea gehyrde \u00feone blindan cleopian, & he sona gestod,\nGehyra\u00fe we nu \u00fe\u00e6t seo mennisce gecynd bi\u00fe a f\u00e6rende, & seo godcunde meht a sta\u00feolf\u00e6stlice stonde\u00fe.\nHw\u00e6t h\u00e6fde seo godcunde \u00feurh \u00fea menniscan nemne buton \u00fe\u00e6t heo mihte beon acenned, & wacian, &\n\u00deonne mar\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6re godcundnesse n\u00e6nig onwendnesse on carcerne w\u00e6s of \u00fe\u00e6re menniscan gecynde,\nHe bi\u00f0 a wesende, & \u00e6ghw\u00e6r ondweard, & \u00e6lce stowe he gefyl\u00fe & ufan oferwryh\u00fe, & a bi\u00fe ece.\n\u00de\u00e6t us tacna\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feurh \u00fea menniscan gecynd ure stefne blindnesse gehyre\u00fe; \u00feonne we ure synna\nEac is to ge\u00feencenne hw\u00e6t Drihten spr\u00e6c, \u00fea se blinda to him com; he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Hw\u00e6t wilt \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee\nN\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t ne \u00fe\u00e6t he nyste hw\u00e6t se blinda wolde, se ealle \u00feing wat, & him leoht forgeaf; ah Drihten\nGelimplice he us l\u00e6rde & monade, hu we us gebiddan sceoldan, & hw\u00e6\u00feere cw\u00e6\u00fe, Eower F\u00e6der se\nWe magan ongytan \u00fe\u00e6t he for\u00feon us gesette \u00fe\u00e6t we hine biddan sceoldan, \u00fey we sceolan \u00feonne eac,\nGehyran we eac \u00fe\u00e6t se blinda ne b\u00e6d goldes, ne seolfres, ne worldglenga, ah b\u00e6d his eagena leohtes.\nHw\u00e6t we witon \u00feonne se mon bi\u00f0 blind, \u00feeah he mycel age & feala f\u00e6geres, \u00fe\u00e6t him bi\u00f0 mycel daru,\nMen \u00fea leofestan, onhyrgean we \u00feone blindan \u00fee on lichoman w\u00e6s geh\u00e6led ge eac on mode.\nNe biddan we urne Drihten \u00feyses l\u00e6nan welan, ne \u00feyssa eor\u00felicra geofa \u00fee hr\u00e6dlice from monnum\n\u00deis leoht we habba\u00fe wi\u00f0 nytenu gem\u00e6ne, ac \u00fe\u00e6t leoht we sceolan secan \u00fe\u00e6t we motan habban mid\n\u00de\u00e6t leoht on nanre tide ne ablinne\u00fe; o\u00feon leohte is fulfremednesse weg \u00fee we on feran sceolan, \u00fe\u00e6t is\nSwi\u00fee ea\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6g beon \u00fe\u00e6t sume men \u00feencan o\u00fe\u00fee cwe\u00fean, hu m\u00e6g ic secan \u00fe\u00e6t gastlice leoht \u00fee\n\u00de\u00e6m men m\u00e6g beon swi\u00fee ra\u00fee geondweard.\nHw\u00e6t gelyfe\u00fe se lichoma butan \u00feurh \u00fea sawle?\nGe\u00feencean \u00fea men \u00fe\u00e6t hie heora sylfra sawla geseon ne magon; ac eal swa hw\u00e6t swa se gesenelica\n& \u00feonne seo sawl hie ged\u00e6le\u00fe wi\u00feone lichoman, hwylc bi\u00f0 he \u00feonne buton swylce stan, o\u00fe\u00fee treow?\nNe he hine na ne onstyre\u00fe, sy\u00fe\u00fean seo ungesynelice sawl him of bi\u00fe; ac sona he molsna\u00fe, & wyr\u00fe to\n& bi\u00f0 \u00feonne undea\u00felic, \u00feeah he \u00e6r dea\u00felic w\u00e6re \u00fea heo hine onfeng, & sceal \u00feeah beon gelic his\nGehyron we nu, men \u00fea leofestan, hw\u00e6t awriten is on Godes bocum, \u00fe\u00e6t se mon se \u00fee god onginne\u00fe\nAc se \u00fee god onginne\u00fe, & on \u00feon \u00feurhwuna\u00fe o\u00fe ende his lifes, se bi\u00f0 hal geworden.\nFor\u00feon we habba\u00fe ned\u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t we ongyton \u00fea blindnesse ure \u00e6l\u00feeodignesse; we send on \u00feisse\nWe synd on \u00feisse worlde \u00e6l\u00feeodige, & swa w\u00e6ron si\u00fe\u00feon se \u00e6resta ealdor \u00feisses menniscan cynnes\n& for\u00feon gylte we w\u00e6ron on \u00feysne wr\u00e6csi\u00fe sende, & nu eft sceolon o\u00feerne e\u00feel secan, swa wite, swa\nGif we willa\u00fe nu on Drihten gelyfan, & hine ongytan, \u00feonne beo we sittende be \u00fe\u00e6m wege, swa se\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon \u00feone geleafan & \u00fe\u00e6t ondgit mid godum d\u00e6dum gefyllan, \u00feonne beo we\nHer us cy\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t se godspellere s\u00e6de hu Drihten cw\u00e6\u00fe to Petre, \u00fea he b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t he moste faran & his\nH\u00e6lend him \u00fea ondswarede & cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feu scealt fylgean me, & l\u00e6tan \u00fea deadan bergean heora deade.\nOn \u00feon he us bysene onstealde \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nig mon ne sceal lufian ne ne geman his gesibbes, gif he hine\nGe\u00feencean we eac \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten his englas gesceop, & heofen & eor\u00fean, s\u00e6, & ealle \u00fea gesceafta \u00fee on\nHw\u00e6\u00feere he hine to \u00feon geea\u00femedde for ure ned\u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t he astah on medmycelne inno\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re a\n& \u00fea nolde he him gesceosan welige yldran, ac \u00fea \u00fee h\u00e6fdon lytle worldspeda, ne hie n\u00e6fdan for him\n& hw\u00e6\u00feere hie w\u00e6ron of Dauides cynnes strynde, \u00fe\u00e6s rihtcynecynnes.\nNu we gehyra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten forseah \u00feone welan \u00feisse worlde; & he eft \u00e6fter f\u00e6ce \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m unl\u00e6dum\nHie hine swungon, & bundon, & sp\u00e6tledon on his onsyne, & mid bradre hand slogan, & mid heora\nEal \u00feis he \u00ferowode for ure lufan & h\u00e6lo; \u00fey he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00fe\u00e6t heofenlice rice onfengon, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea\nHw\u00e6t wille we on domes d\u00e6g for\u00feberan \u00fe\u00e6s we for urum Drihtne arefnedon, nu he swa mycel for ure\nMonige men syndon \u00fee cwe\u00fea\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hie on God gelyfon & hine lufian, & \u00feonne hwe\u00feere nella\u00fe\nMen \u00fea men \u00fee \u00feyssum uncystum fylga\u00f0, ne healda\u00fe hie Drihtnes bebodu ne his bysenum ne fylgea\u00f0;\n& se \u00fee him \u00feonne ne wile wi\u00festondan, he him \u00e6t his ende grim geweor\u00fee\u00fe & hine gel\u00e6de\u00fe on ece\nGemunon we nu ure d\u00e6ghwamlican synna \u00fee we wi\u00f0 Godes willan geworht habba\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t we mid\n\u00de\u00e6t bi\u00f0 seo so\u00fee hreow \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00fea geworhtan synna andette & georne bete.\nWepan we nu, & cwe\u00fean & ge\u00feencan hu Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0, Eadige beo\u00fe \u00fea \u00fee nu wepa\u00f0, for\u00feon \u00fee hi\nHw\u00e6t we nu gehyra\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t we magon mid \u00fe\u00e6re so\u00f0an hreowe ece blisse geearnian.\n& eft he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Wa eow \u00fee nu hliha\u00fe, for\u00feon ge eft wepa\u00f0 on ecnesse, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t unasecgenlice wr\u00e6c\nFor\u00feon we sceolan beon gemyndige Godes beboda, & ure sawle \u00feearfe, \u00fea hwile \u00fee we motan, &\n\u00de\u00e6r is ece blis & \u00fe\u00e6t ungeendode rice; nis \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6nig sar gemeted, ne adl, ne ece, ne n\u00e6nig unrotnes;\nAc \u00fe\u00e6r is gefea, & blis, & f\u00e6gernes, & se ham is gefylled mid heofonlicum gastum, mid englum &\nAmen.",
